Package: OSSP
Title: Multi-omics Integration via Spectral Decomposition on Self-diffusion Network
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Duanx", "Lab", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your.email@example.com")
Description: OSSP is an unsupervised framework for integrating cancer multi-omics data. 
    It uses self-diffusion to enhance similarity networks and spectral decomposition 
    for feature integration and patient subtyping.
